INFO     rag_service.services.generation_service:generation_service.py:427 {"event": "rag_query_trace", "query": "How many patients will be randomised and in what ratio?", "retrieval_query": null, "system_prompt_version": "440b2406", "retrieved_chunks": [{"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 9, "section": "NUMBER OF PATIENTS", "score": 0.9797453, "scores": null, "had_context": true}, {"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 37, "section": "4.2.2 Randomisation", "score": 0.97414124, "scores": null, "had_context": true}, {"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 29, "section": "3.2 Planned Number of Patients", "score": 0.9574373, "scores": null, "had_context": true}, {"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 66, "section": "9.2 Patient Disposition", "score": 0.80084777, "scores": null, "had_context": true}, {"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 36, "section": "4.2.2 Randomisation", "score": 0.7409249, "scores": null, "had_context": true}, {"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 92, "section": "Appendix 4 - Summary of Changes for Version 1.1", "score": 0.44215468, "scores": null, "had_context": true}], "context_char_count": 5118, "response": "Source: Protocol Ulcerative Colitis.pdf\n\n1. A total of 90 patients with active UC will be enrolled competitively and randomised equally into three arms with TJ301 (two dose levels) or placebo, across approximately 25\u201330 investigational sites globally.\n[Section 3.2 Planned Number of Patients \u00b7 p.29]\n\n2. At the Randomisation Visit (Visit 2), patients will be centrally, dynamically randomised in a 1:1:1 fashion to each of the three arms: placebo, TJ301 300 mg, or TJ301 600 mg, via a validated Interactive Web Response System (IWRS). Randomisation will be stratified by prior corticosteroids treatment (yes/no) and consent to participate in PK substudy (yes/no).\n[Section 4.2.2 Randomisation \u00b7 p.36]\n\n3. In addition, a PK subgroup of 24 patients (from Mainland China only), with 8 patients per arm, will also be randomised in a 1:1:1 fashion across the three arms.\n[Section 4.2.2 Randomisation \u00b7 p.37]", "sources": [{"name": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 9, "section": "NUMBER OF PATIENTS", "exactText": "", "bboxes": [[72.0, 209.78398291015628, 532.824, 184.3749752178486]], "relevance": "high"}, {"name": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 37, "section": "4.2.2 Randomisation", "exactText": "", "bboxes": [[71.99999999999994, 696.1439829101562, 538.0799999999999, 655.4949752178485]], "relevance": "high"}, {"name": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 29, "section": "3.2 Planned Number of Patients", "exactText": "", "bboxes": [[72.0, 653.5439829101564, 534.48, 612.8949752178487]], "relevance": "high"}, {"name": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 66, "section": "9.2 Patient Disposition", "exactText": "", "bboxes": [[72.00000000000011, 433.70398291015636, 511.4400000000001, 393.0549752178486]], "relevance": "high"}, {"name": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 36, "section": "4.2.2 Randomisation", "exactText": "", "bboxes": [[72.0, 233.90398291015606, 538.44, 178.01497521784836]], "relevance": "high"}, {"name": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 92, "section": "Appendix 4 - Summary of Changes for Version 1.1", "exactText": "", "bboxes": [[52.59044647216797, 495.76949310302734, 771.7723999023438, 121.96722412109375]], "relevance": "high"}], "timing": {"response_cache_hit": false, "semantic_cache_hit": false, "chunks_compressed": false, "condense_ms": 0.0017909333109855652, "query_condensed": false, "embedding_ms": 744.694875087589, "embedding_cache_hit": false, "retrieval": {"chunk_cache_hit": false, "confidence_filter_applied": true, "confidence_filter_threshold": 0.04, "confidence_filter_bm25_threshold": null, "confidence_filter_input_count": 45, "confidence_filter_kept_count": 45, "confidence_filter_dropped_count": 0, "confidence_filter_kept_scores": [0.5998, 0.5933, 0.5788, 0.5593, 0.5576, 0.5298, 0.49