INFO     rag_service.services.generation_service:generation_service.py:427 {"event": "rag_query_trace", "query": "How many site visits are there and what are they?", "retrieval_query": null, "system_prompt_version": "440b2406", "retrieved_chunks": [{"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 73, "section": "11.1 Periodic Monitoring", "score": 0.005099818, "scores": null, "had_context": true}, {"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 52, "section": "6.4 Unscheduled Visits", "score": 0.0021239663, "scores": null, "had_context": true}, {"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 9, "section": "Study Flowchart", "score": 0.0018895386, "scores": null, "had_context": true}, {"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 45, "section": "Table 1 Time and Events Schedule", "score": 0.0014269596, "scores": null, "had_context": true}, {"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 44, "section": "Table 1 Time and Events Schedule", "score": 0.0013831174, "scores": null, "had_context": true}, {"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 26, "section": "3.1.2 Overall Design", "score": 0.0012303583, "scores": null, "had_context": true}], "context_char_count": 8263, "response": "Source: Protocol Ulcerative Colitis.pdf\n\nThe trial includes a total of **10 scheduled visits** (plus sub-visits), spanning the Run-in, Screening, Treatment, and Follow-up periods. The visits are as follows:\n\n1. **Visit 0** \u2013 Stabilisation (Run-in Period)\n[Section Table 1 Time and Events Schedule \u00b7 p.45]\n\n2. **Visit 1** \u2013 Screening Visit (start of Screening Period; Days -28 to -1 prior to Visit 2). Includes disease activity assessment and endoscopy (colonoscopy or sigmoidoscopy), with mucosal biopsies collected.\n[Section Study Flowchart \u00b7 p.9]\n\n3. **Visit 1.1** \u2013 Baseline (Screening Period)\n[Section Table 1 Time and Events Schedule \u00b7 p.45]\n\n4. **Visit 2** \u2013 Randomisation Visit / Baseline (start of 12-week Double-blind Treatment Period)\n[Section 3.1.2 Overall Design \u00b7 p.26]\n\n5. **Visits 2.1, 2.2, 2.3** \u2013 Sub-visits during the Treatment Period\n[Section Table 1 Time and Events Schedule \u00b7 p.44]\n\n6. **Visit 3** \u2013 Week 2 (Treatment Period); disease activity assessment\n[Section Study Flowchart \u00b7 p.9]\n\n7. **Visit 4** \u2013 Week 4 (Treatment Period); disease activity assessment\n[Section Study Flowchart \u00b7 p.9]\n\n8. **Visit 5** \u2013 Week 6 (Treatment Period); disease activity assessment\n[Section Study Flowchart \u00b7 p.9]\n\n9. **Visit 6** \u2013 Week 8 (Treatment Period); disease activity assessment\n[Section Study Flowchart \u00b7 p.9]\n\n10. **Visit 7** \u2013 Week 10 (Treatment Period); disease activity assessment\n[Section Study Flowchart \u00b7 p.9]\n\n11. **Visits 7.1, 7.2, 7.3** \u2013 Sub-visits during the Treatment Period\n[Section Table 1 Time and Events Schedule \u00b7 p.44]\n\n12. **Visit 8 (EoT Visit)** \u2013 End of Treatment Visit, Week 12 (completion of 12-week Treatment Period). Includes disease activity assessment and endoscopy with mucosal biopsies.\n[Section 3.1.2 Overall Design \u00b7 p.26]\n\n13. **Visit 8.1** \u2013 Sub-visit during Follow-up Period\n[Section Table 1 Time and Events Schedule \u00b7 p.44]\n\n14. **Visit 9** \u2013 Safety Follow-up Visit, scheduled 35 days after the last dose of IMP (Day 105)\n[Section Study Flowchart \u00b7 p.9]\n\nIn addition, **unscheduled visits** may occur at the discretion of the Investigator or Sponsor for safety reasons or to complete missed assessments.\n[Section 6.4 Unscheduled Visits \u00b7 p.52]", "sources": [{"name": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 9, "section": "Study Flowchart", "exactText": "Visit 1: Screening Visit, start of Screening Period (Days -28 to -1 prior to Visit 2) - Visit 2: Randomisation Visit (Baseline), start of 12-week Treatment Period - Visits 3-7: 5 visits during 12-week Treatment Period - Visit 8: End of Treatment (EoT) Visit, completion of 12-week Treatment Period 