INFO     rag_service.services.generation_service:generation_service.py:427 {"event": "rag_query_trace", "query": "What is the infusion time for the study drug?", "retrieval_query": null, "system_prompt_version": "440b2406", "retrieved_chunks": [{"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 94, "section": "Appendix 4 - Summary of Changes for Version 1.1", "score": 0.9034647, "scores": null, "had_context": true}, {"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 40, "section": "5.4 Conditions for Storage and Use", "score": 0.8818186, "scores": null, "had_context": true}, {"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 39, "section": "5.1 Treatments Administered", "score": 0.82782817, "scores": null, "had_context": true}, {"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 12, "section": "Investigational Medicinal Product (IMP)", "score": 0.8248855, "scores": null, "had_context": true}, {"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 9, "section": "Study Flowchart", "score": 0.07303239, "scores": null, "had_context": true}, {"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 32, "section": "3.4.5 Selection and Timing of Dose for Each Patient", "score": 0.07030385, "scores": null, "had_context": true}], "context_char_count": 8094, "response": "Source: Protocol Ulcerative Colitis.pdf\n\nThe infusion time for the study drug (TJ301/placebo) is **2 hours**.\n\n1. \"The infusion time is 2 hours.\"\n[Section 5.1 Treatments Administered \u00b7 p.39]\n\n2. \"The infusion time will be 2 hours.\"\n[Section 5.4 Conditions for Storage and Use \u00b7 p.40]\n\n3. This was revised from an earlier version (Version 1.0) which specified \"2 hour \u00b1 3 min.\" The rationale for removing the \u00b13 min tolerance was that for some sites, it may be difficult to control the dosing time within \u00b13 min.\n[Section Appendix 4 - Summary of Changes for Version 1.1 \u00b7 p.94]", "sources": [{"name": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 39, "section": "5.1 Treatments Administered", "exactText