INFO     rag_service.services.generation_service:generation_service.py:427 {"event": "rag_query_trace", "query": "What is the size of the PK subgroup and where is it based?", "retrieval_query": null, "system_prompt_version": "440b2406", "retrieved_chunks": [{"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 37, "section": "4.2.2 Randomisation", "score": 0.96405166, "scores": null, "had_context": true}, {"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 27, "section": "3.1.2 Overall Design", "score": 0.9142907, "scores": null, "had_context": true}, {"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 51, "section": "6.2.5 PK Visits", "score": 0.88161486, "scores": null, "had_context": true}, {"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 57, "section": "7.5 Handling of Biological Samples", "score": 0.5034446, "scores": null, "had_context": true}, {"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 67, "section": "9.4.5 PK Analysis Set", "score": 0.21502088, "scores": null, "had_context": true}, {"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 56, "section": "7.4 Drug Concentration Measurements", "score": 0.06418265, "scores": null, "had_context": true}], "context_char_count": 5412, "response": "Source: Protocol Ulcerative Colitis.pdf\n\nThe PK subgroup consists of 24 patients, based in Mainland China, allocated equally across the three treatment arms.\n\n1. The PK subgroup comprises 24 patients (8 per arm), located in Mainland China, electronically assigned at randomisation and consenting to the extra procedures.\n[Section 3.1.2 Overall Design \u00b7 p.27]\n\n2. The PK subgroup patients are centrally and dynamically randomised in a 1:1:1 fashion to each of the three arms (placebo, TJ301 300 mg, or TJ301 600 mg), with N=24 and 8 patients per arm.\n[Section 4.2.2 Randomisation \u00b7 p.37]", "sources": [{"name": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 27, "section": "3.1.2 Overall Design", "exactText": "TJ301 PK will be assessed in a subgroup of patients in Mainland China (24 pa