INFO     rag_service.services.generation_service:generation_service.py:427 {"event": "rag_query_trace", "query": "What assessments are performed at the Week 12 (End of Treatment) visit?", "retrieval_query": null, "system_prompt_version": "440b2406", "retrieved_chunks": [{"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 9, "section": "Study Flowchart", "score": 0.9923638, "scores": null, "had_context": true}, {"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 26, "section": "3.1.2 Overall Design", "score": 0.99187535, "scores": null, "had_context": true}, {"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 50, "section": "6.2.4 12-week Treatment Period (Visits 3 to 8)", "score": null, "scores": [0.9467938, 0.6296608], "had_context": true}, {"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 24, "section": "Primary Endpoints", "score": 0.75815266, "scores": null, "had_context": true}, {"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 7, "section": "Secondary Endpoints", "score": 0.41501737, "scores": null, "had_context": true}], "context_char_count": 6234, "response": "Source: Protocol Ulcerative Colitis.pdf\n\nThe following assessments are performed at the Week 12 (End of Treatment) Visit (Visit 8):\n\n1. **Endoscopy (sigmoidoscopy)** is conducted at Visit 8 (Week 12).\n[Section 6.2.4 12-week Treatment Period (Visits 3 to 8) \u00b7 p.50]\n\n2. **Mucosal biopsies** for assessment of mucosal healing, histology, and immunohistochemistry are collected during endoscopy at this time point.\n[Section 3.1.2 Overall Design \u00b7 p.26]\n\n3. **Full Mayo Score efficacy evaluation** (9-point partial Mayo Score without endoscopy at all visits; full Mayo Score specifically at Visit 8).\n[Section 6.2.4 12-week Treatment Period (Visits 3 to 8) \u00b7 p.50]\n\n4. **Blood sampling for PK assessments** (conducted at all visits, including Visit 8).\n[Section 6.2.4 12-week Treatment Period (Visits 3 to 8) \u00b7 p.50]\n\n5. **Faeces sampling for calprotectin** (at Visits 4, 6, and 8).\n[Section 6.2.4 12-week Treatment Period (Visits 3 to 8) \u00b7 p.50]\n\n6. **Blood sampling for exploratory biomarkers** (at Visit 8, must be taken when the patient is in a fasting state [\u22658 hours]).\n[Section 6.2.4 12-week Treatment Period (Visits 3 to 8) \u00b7 p.50]\n\n7. **Clinical laboratory tests** (blood and urine sampling; all visits, including Visit 8).\n[Section 6.2.4 12-week Treatment Period (Visits 3 to 8) \u00b7 p.50]\n\n8. **Urine pregnancy test** (at Visit 8).\n[Section 6.2.4 12-week Treatment Period (Visits 3 to 8) \u00b7 p.50]\n\n9. **Blood sampling for anti-TJ301 antibodies** (at Visits 3, 4, 6, and 8).\n[Section 6.2.4 12-week Treatment Period (Visits 3 to 8) \u00b7 p.50]\n\n10. **Physical examination** including body weight (at Visits 4, 6, and 8).\n[Section 6.2.4 12-week Treatment Period (Visits 3 to 8) \u00b7 p.50]\n\n11. **Vital signs** (all visits, including Visit 8).\n[Section 6.2.4 12-week Treatment Period (Visits 3 to 8) \u00b7 p.50]\n\n12. **12-lead ECG** (all visits, including Visit 8).\n[Section 6.2.4 12-week Treatment Period (Visits 3 to 8) \u00b7 p.50]\n\n13. **Diary review** (all visits, including Visit 8).\n[Section 6.2.4 12-week Treatment Period (Visits 3 to 8) \u00b7 p.50]\n\n14. **Concomitant medications documented** (all visits, including Visit 8).\n[Section 6.2.4 12-week Treatment Period (Visits 3 to 8) \u00b7 p.50]\n\n15. **Adverse events documented** (all visits, including Visit 8).\n[Section 6.2.4 12-week Treatment Period (Visits 3 to 8) \u00b7 p.50]", "sources": [{"name": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 9, "section": "Study Flowchart", "exactText": "", "bboxes": [[90.0, 670.7999829101562, 502.92, 660.0549752178486]], "relevance": "high"}, {"name": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 26, "section": "3.1.2 Overall Design", "exactText": "", "bboxes": [[89.99999999999989, 225.47998291015642, 541.6799999999998, 214.73497521784873]], "relevance": "high"}, {"name": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 50, "section": "6.2.4 1