INFO     rag_service.services.generation_service:generation_service.py:427 {"event": "rag_query_trace", "query": "What changed in the randomisation stratification between protocol versions?", "retrieval_query": null, "system_prompt_version": "440b2406", "retrieved_chunks": [{"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 90, "section": "Appendix 4 - Summary of Changes for Version 1.1", "score": null, "scores": [0.99090964, 0.99090964], "had_context": true}, {"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 92, "section": "Appendix 4 - Summary of Changes for Version 1.1", "score": 0.98475236, "scores": null, "had_context": true}, {"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 94, "section": "Appendix 4 - Summary of Changes for Version 1.1", "score": 0.8984106, "scores": null, "had_context": true}, {"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 95, "section": "Appendix 4 - Summary of Changes for Version 1.1", "score": 0.690872, "scores": null, "had_context": true}, {"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 93, "section": "Appendix 4 - Summary of Changes for Version 1.1", "score": 0.5621765, "scores": null, "had_context": true}], "context_char_count": 7655, "response": "Source: Protocol Ulcerative Colitis.pdf\n\nThe randomisation stratification factors were modified between Version 1.0 and Version 1.1 of the CTJ301UC201 protocol. The specific changes were as follows:\n\n1. **Original stratification factors (Version 1.0):** 90 patients were to be centrally, dynamically, stratified randomly by:\n   - Elevated (\u22653 mg/L) CRP levels, **and**\n   - Stable conventional treatment (prior treatment with amino salicylates, corticosteroids, and immunosuppressive drugs)\n[Section Appendix 4 - Summary of Changes for Version 1.1 \u00b7 p.92]\n\n2. **Revised stratification factors (Version 1.1):** 90 patients are to be centrally, dynamically, randomly assigned, with randomisation stratified by:\n   - Prior corticosteroids treatment (yes/no), **and**\n   - Consent to participate in PK substudy (yes/no)\n[Section Appendix 4 - Summary of Changes for Version 1.1 \u00b7 p.92]\n\n3. These changes applied across multiple sections of the protocol, including sections 3.1.2, the Synopsis, 4.2.2, and 9.6.2.\n[Section Appendix 4 - Summary of Changes for Version 1.1 \u00b7 p.92]\n\n4. The high-level summary of changes also notes that the stratification factors in randomization were clarified as one of the main purposes of the revision.\n[Section Appendix 4 - Summary of Changes for Version 1.1 \u00b7 p.90]", "sources": [{"name": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 92, "section": "Appendix 4 - Summary of Changes for Version 1.1", "exactText": "90 patients will be centrally, dynamically, stratified randomly (by elevated ( \u22653 mg/L) CRP levels, and stable conventional treatment (prior treatment with amino salicylates, corticosteroids, and immunosuppressive drugs)) assigned to 3 groups (1:1:1) to receive 600mg TJ301 biweekly (Q2W), 300mg TJ301 Q2W or placebo Q2W.. 3.1.2, also in Synopsis, 4.2.2 and 9.6.2, 2 = 90 patients will be centrally, dynamically, randomly assigned to 3 groups (1:1:1) to receive 600mg TJ301 biweekly (Q2W), 300mg TJ301 Q2W or placebo Q2W. Randomisation will be stratified by prior corticosteroids treatment (yes/no) and consent to participate in PK substudy (yes/no).", "bboxes": [[52.59044647216797, 495.76949310302734, 771.7723999023438, 121.96722412109375]], "relevance": "high"}, {"name": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 90, "section": "Appendix 4 - Summary of Changes for Version 1.1", "exactText": "Clarify stratification factors in randomization.", "bboxes": [[59.4, 449.0640073242187, 517.92, 438.774999631911]], "relevance": "medium"}], "timing": {"response_cache_hit": false, "semantic_cache_hit": false, "chunks_compressed": true, "condense_ms": 0.0019171275198459625, "query_condensed": false, "embedding_ms": 695.8033749833703, "embedding_cache_hit": false, "retrieval": {"chunk_cache_hit": false, "confidence_filte