INFO     rag_service.services.generation_service:generation_service.py:427 {"event": "rag_query_trace", "query": "Which countries changed between protocol versions?", "retrieval_query": null, "system_prompt_version": "440b2406", "retrieved_chunks": [{"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 90, "section": "Appendix 4 - Summary of Changes for Version 1.1", "score": 0.9444849, "scores": null, "had_context": true}, {"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 92, "section": "Appendix 4 - Summary of Changes for Version 1.1", "score": 0.6659539, "scores": null, "had_context": true}, {"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 75, "section": "12.1 Protocol Amendments", "score": 0.087096825, "scores": null, "had_context": true}, {"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 94, "section": "Appendix 4 - Summary of Changes for Version 1.1", "score": 0.015014749, "scores": null, "had_context": true}, {"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 5, "section": "VERSION OF PROTOCOL OR PROTOCOL AMENDMENT", "score": 0.008156248, "scores": null, "had_context": true}, {"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 91, "section": "Appendix 4 - Summary of Changes for Version 1.1", "score": 0.0061689946, "scores": null, "had_context": true}], "context_char_count": 7945, "response": "Source: Protocol Ulcerative Colitis.pdf\n\nThe country change between protocol versions (V1.0 to V1.1) was as follows:\n\n1. **Germany was removed** and **Australia was added** as a study country/region. The Sponsor decided to conduct the study at sites in Mainland China, Taiwan, Korea, and Australia instead of sites in Mainland China, Taiwan, Korea, and Germany.\n[Section Appendix 4 - Summary of Changes for Version 1.1 \u00b7 p.90]\n\n2. This change was reflected across multiple sections of the protocol, including the Cover page, Synopsis, and Section 6.1.\n[Section Appendix 4 - Summary of Changes for Version 1.1 \u00b7 p.92]", "sources": [{"name": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "p