INFO     rag_service.services.generation_service:generation_service.py:427 {"event": "rag_query_trace", "query": "What does CRP refer to and how is it used in this protocol?", "retrieval_query": null, "system_prompt_version": "440b2406", "retrieved_chunks": [{"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 18, "section": "List of Abbreviations", "score": 0.038466193, "scores": null, "had_context": true}, {"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 16, "section": "Protocol No.: CTJ301UC201", "score": null, "scores": [0.013325147, 0.0047737225], "had_context": true}, {"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 17, "section": "Protocol No.: CTJ301UC201", "score": null, "scores": [0.0068239546, 0.0060503976], "had_context": true}, {"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 87, "section": "Exploratory Biomarkers:", "score": 0.0050800373, "scores": null, "had_context": true}], "context_char_count": 3759, "response": "Source: Protocol Ulcerative Colitis.pdf\n\n1. CRP stands for **C-Reactive Protein**, as defined in the List of Abbreviations section of the protocol.\n[Section List of Abbreviations \u00b7 p.18]\n\n2. In this protocol, CRP is used as an **exploratory biomarker**, measured from blood samples. It is assessed alongside other exploratory biomarkers including ESR, IL-6, IL-6/sIL-6R complex, neutrophil and platelet count (from blood), and calprotectin (from faeces), as part of the comprehensive clinical evaluation of TJ301 in ulcerative colitis patients.\n[Section Exploratory Biomarkers: \u00b7 p.87]", "sources": [{"name": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 18, "section": "List of Abbreviations", "exactText": "CRP\nC-Reactive Protein", "bboxes": [[72.0, 679.9084629101563, 121.77935999999998, 670.4425758332333]], "relevance": "high"}, {"name": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 87, "section": "Exploratory Biomarkers:", "exactText": "Exploratory Biomarkers:\n- From blood: C-reactive protein (CRP), ESR, IL-6, IL-6/sIL-6R complex, neutrophil and platelet count\n- From faeces: calprotectin", "bboxes": [[72.0, 721.4399829101562, 554.5199999999999, 693.5349752178486]], "relevance": "high"}], "timing": {"response_cache_hit": false, "semantic_cache_hit": false, "chunks_compressed": true, "condense_ms": 0.0009578652679920197, "query_condensed": false, "embedding_ms": 655.5683328770101, "embedding_cache_hit": false, "retrieval": {"chunk_cache_hit": false, "confidence_filter_applied": true, "confidence_filter_threshold": 0.04, "confidence_filter_bm25_threshold": null, "confidence_filter_input_count": 45, "confidence_filter_kept_count": 45, "confidence_filter_dropped_count": 0, "confidence_filter_kept_scores": [0.5114, 0.4703, 0.4695, 0.4674, 0.4599, 0.4585, 0.4578, 0.4571, 0.4556, 0.4545, 0.454, 0.4511, 0.4495, 0.449, 0.4481, 0.4463, 0.4445, 0.4437, 0.4404, 0.4403, 0.4402, 0.4397, 0.4396, 0.4391, 0.4384, 0.4367, 0.435, 0.435, 0.4332, 0.4322, 0.4293, 0.4288, 0.4267, 0.4256, 0.4249, 0.4241, 0.4239, 0.4237, 0.4231, 0.4229, 0.4229, 0.4229, 0.4228, 0.4227, 0.4218], "confidence_filter_dropped_scores": [], "confidence_filter_bm25_only_scores_normalized": [], "hybrid_search": true, "cache_hit": true, "embedding_ms": 0.0, "db_search_ms": 5655.66537482664, "hybrid_parallel_ms": 6071.944584138691, "vector_count": 45, "bm25_count": 0, "fused_count": 45, "reranker_enabled": true, "reranker_provider": "cohere", "reranker_ms": 345.56016605347395, "reranker_input_count": 45, "reranker_output_count": 6, "reranker_model": "rerank-english-v3.0", "retrieval_total_ms": 6435.116666834801}, "original_chunk_count": 6, "compression_ms": 0.19120890647172928, "compressed_chunk_count": 4, "llm_call_ms": 9009.334333706647, "provider": "anthropic", "model": "claude-sonnet-4-6", "generation_total_ms": 16102.159750182182}}
