INFO     rag_service.services.generation_service:generation_service.py:427 {"event": "rag_query_trace", "query": "How many patients have been enrolled so far?", "retrieval_query": null, "system_prompt_version": "440b2406", "retrieved_chunks": [{"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 9, "section": "NUMBER OF PATIENTS", "score": 0.99411184, "scores": null, "had_context": true}, {"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 12, "section": "Sample Size", "score": 0.9639839, "scores": null, "had_context": true}, {"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 29, "section": "3.2 Planned Number of Patients", "score": 0.9551521, "scores": null, "had_context": true}, {"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 66, "section": "9.1 Determination of Sample Size", "score": null, "scores": [0.94197524, 0.064535476], "had_context": true}, {"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 36, "section": "4.2.1 Recruitment", "score": 0.66530186, "scores": null, "had_context": true}], "context_char_count": 5384, "response": "Source: Protocol Ulcerative Colitis.pdf\n\nThe protocol specifies the **planned** enrollment target, but does not provide information on how many patients have actually been enrolled to date. I don't have this information regarding the current actual enrollment figures.\n\nWhat the protocol does state about planned enrollment is:\n\n1. A total of **90 patients** with active UC are planned to be enrolled competitively across approximately 25\u201330 investigational sites globally, randomised equally into three arms (TJ301 two dose levels, or placebo).\n[Section 3.2 Planned Number of Patients \u00b7 p.29]\n\n2. The sample size of 90 accounts for an approximately **20% dropout rate**, with 72 evaluable patients (n=24 per arm) needed to achieve the target statistical power.\n[Section 9.1 Determination of Sample Size \u00b7 p.66]", "sources": [{"name": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 9, "section": "NUMBER OF PATIENTS", "exactText": "", "bboxes