, 2014).\n[Section 17 REFERENCES \u00b7 p.82]\n\nI don't have this information regarding a full competitive landscape of marketed ulcerative colitis drugs, as the document does not systematically enumerate all available treatments on the market.", "sources": [{"name": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 23, "section": "1.3 Benefit / Risk Aspects", "exactText": "", "bboxes": [[71.99999999999989, 395.78398291015617, 545.5199999999998, 355.1349752178484], [71.99999999999989, 618.6239829101562, 558.9599999999998, 502.1349752178485]], "relevance": "high"}, {"name": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 24, "section": "Primary Objective", "exactText": "", "bboxes": [[89.99999999999999, 665.3999829101564, 523.5600000000001, 654.6549752178487]], "relevance": "high"}, {"name": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 32, "section": "3.4.4 Selection of Doses in the Trial", "exactText": "", "bboxes": [[71.99999999999994, 422.7839829101563, 552.8399999999997, 336.6549752178485]], "relevance": "high"}, {"name": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 82, "section": "17 REFERENCES", "exactText": "", "bboxes": [[90.0, 738.5039829101562, 542.328, 713.0949752178485]], "relevance": "high"}, {"name": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 48, "section": "6.2.1 Run-in Period (Stabilization Period, Visit 0)", "exactText": "", "bboxes": [[89.87999999999988, 507.8399829101564, 342.3599999999999, 497.0949752178487]], "relevance": "high"}], "timing": {"response_cache_hit": false, "semantic_cache_hit": false, "chunks_compressed": true, "condense_ms": 0.0008749775588512421, "query_condensed": false, "embedding_ms": 636.2797082401812, "embedding_cache_hit": false, "retrieval": {"chunk_cache_hit": false, "confidence_filter_applied": true, "confidence_filter_threshold": 0.04, "confidence_filter_bm25_threshold": null, "confidence_filter_input_count": 44, "confidence_filter_kept_count": 44, "confidence_filter_dropped_count": 0, "confidence_filter_kept_scores": [0.4356, 0.5098, 0.5053, 0.5019, 0.4