INFO     rag_service.services.generation_service:generation_service.py:427 {"event": "rag_query_trace", "query": "What is the dose?", "retrieval_query": null, "system_prompt_version": "440b2406", "retrieved_chunks": [{"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 23, "section": "1.2 Scientific Justification for Conducting the Trial", "score": 0.08882029, "scores": null, "had_context": true}, {"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 30, "section": "3.4.4 Selection of Doses in the Trial", "score": null, "scores": [0.083142914, 0.083142914], "had_context": true}, {"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 31, "section": "3.4.4 Selection of Doses in the Trial", "score": null, "scores": [0.059101548, 0.059101548, 0.053107902], "had_context": true}], "context_char_count": 6474, "response": "Source: Protocol Ulcerative Colitis.pdf\n\nThe trial includes multiple dose levels. Based on the dose selection rationale, three doses of TJ301 are being tested, all administered every other week (intravenous infusion):\n\n1. **75 mg every other week** \u2014 anticipated to suppress the STAT-3 second messenger signal to baseline level for at least one week, with approximately 80% target occupancy after 14 days.\n[Section 3.4.4 Selection of Doses in the Trial \u00b7 p.31]\n\n2. **300 mg every other week** \u2014 anticipated to suppress IL-6/sIL-6R second messenger signal (STAT-3) to baseline, with trough levels expected to be >1 \u00b5g/mL.\n[Section 3.4.4 Selection of Doses in the Trial \u00b7 p.31]\n\n3. **600 mg every other week** \u2014 the highest dose selected, anticipated to suppress STAT-3 activation to baseline (trough levels >1 \u00b5g/mL), and selected to likely cover the highest anticipated dose in the therapeutic range of TJ301.\n[Section 3.4.4 Selection of Doses in the Trial \u00b7 p.31]\n\nThe overall dose range tested in prior Phase 1 studies was 0.75 mg to 750 mg, all of which were found to be safe and tolerable.\n[Section 1.2 Scientific Justification for Conducting the Trial \u00b7 p.23]", "sources": [{"name": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 23, "section": "1.2 Scientific Justification for Conducting the Trial", "exactText": "", "bboxes": [[71.99999999999989, 618.6239829101562, 558.9599999999998, 502.1349752178485]], "relevance": "high"}, {"name": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 30, "section": "3.4.4 Selection of Doses in the Trial", "exactText": "", "bboxes": [[72.00000000000006, 263.9039829101562, 543.4800000000001, 192.89497521784858], [72.00000000000006, 263.9039829101562, 543.4800000000001, 192.89497521784858]], "relevance": "high"}, {"name": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 31, "section": "3.4.4 Selection of Doses in the Trial", "exactText": "", "bboxes": [[71.99999999999966, 502.10398291015616, 544.4399999999995, 415.8549752178484], [71.99999999999966, 502.10398291015616, 544.4399999999995, 415.8549752178484], [71.9999999999996, 399.0239829101561, 549.1199999999995, 297.65497521784835]], "relevance": "high"}], "timing": {"response_cache_hit": false, "semantic_cache_hit": false, "chunks_compressed": true, "condense_ms": 0.001084059476852417, "query_condensed": false, "embedding_ms": 713.8169589452446, "embedding_cache_hit": false, "retrieval": {"chunk_cache_hit": false, "confidence_filter_applied": true, "confidence_filter_threshold": 0.04, "confidence_filter_bm25_threshold": null, "confidence_filter_input_count": 90, "confidence_filter_kept_count": 90, "confidence_filter_dropped_count": 0, "confidence_filter_kept_scores": [0.4496, 0.418, 0.4155, 0.3952, 0.3916, 0.3853, 0.3852, 0.3691, 0.3689, 0.3664, 0.3624, 0.3615, 0.3612, 0.3608, 0.3605, 0.3574, 0.3524, 0.3518, 0.3484, 0.3469, 0.3467, 0.3465, 0.3446, 0.3431, 0.3429, 0.3421, 0.3418, 0.3393, 0.3382, 0.336, 0.3349, 0.3348, 0.3335, 0.3331, 0.3317, 0.3296, 0.3287, 0.3281, 0.3268, 0.3252, 0.3213, 0.3208, 0.3204, 0.3188, 0.3183], "confidence_filter_dropped_scores": [], "confidence_filter_bm25_only_scores_normalized": [1.0, 0.9673, 0.9451, 0.9