INFO     rag_service.services.generation_service:generation_service.py:427 {"event": "rag_query_trace", "query": "(1) What are the inclusion criteria?", "retrieval_query": null, "system_prompt_version": "440b2406", "retrieved_chunks": [{"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 34, "section": "4.1.1 Inclusion Criteria", "score": null, "scores": [0.99866986, 0.99866986, 0.99727446], "had_context": true}, {"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 9, "section": "Inclusion Criteria", "score": null, "scores": [0.9956346, 0.9956346], "had_context": true}, {"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 10, "section": "Inclusion Criteria", "score": 0.9783019, "scores": null, "had_context": true}], "context_char_count": 5642, "response": "Source: Protocol Ulcerative Colitis.pdf\n\nA subject will be eligible for inclusion in this study only if **all** of the following criteria apply:\n\n1. Male and female patients 18-70 (inclusive) years of age.\n[Section 4.1.1 Inclusion Criteria \u00b7 p.34]\n\n2. Active UC confirmed by colonoscopy with biopsy or flexible sigmoidoscopy with biopsy at Screening, with extending > 15-cm past the anal verge from endoscopy.\n[Section 4.1.1 Inclusion Criteria \u00b7 p.34]\n\n3. Active UC with a full Mayo score \u2265 5 and a rectal bleeding subscore \u22651 at screening.\n[Section 4.1.1 Inclusion Criteria \u00b7 p.34]\n\n4. During Day -35 to Day -6 prior to Randomisation, an endoscopy subscore \u22652.\n[Section 4.1.1 Inclusion Criteria \u00b7 p.34]\n\n5. Treated with conventional non-biological UC therapy: with corticosteroids stable for at least 2 weeks prior to Randomization at no more than 20 mg prednisone (or equivalent), and/or with medications containing 5-aminosalicylates (5-ASA) at no less than 2 g 5-ASA per day for at least 3 months and stable for at least 4 weeks prior to Randomization, and/or with azathioprine (AZA) at no less than 1.5 mg/kg/day or mercaptopurine (6-MP) at no less than 0.75 mg/kg/day for at least 6 months and stable for at least 6 weeks prior to Randomization.\n[Section 4.1.1 Inclusion Criteria \u00b7 p.34]\n\n6. A female subject has been sterilized or has been menopausal, or the subject has no pregnancy plan during the trial and voluntarily adopts effective contraceptive measures.\n[Section 4.1.1 Inclusion Criteria \u00b7 p.34]\n\n7. The patient is able and willing to comply with the requirements of this trial protocol.\n[Section 4.1.1 Inclusion Criteria \u00b7 p.34]\n\n8. The subject should be able to read and write to understand and fill out Patient Diary.\n[Section 4.1.1 Inclusion Criteria \u00b7 p.34]\n\n9. Voluntarily signed Informed Consent obtained before any trial-related procedures are performed.\n[Section 4.1.1 Inclusion Criteria \u00b7 p.34]", "sources": [{"name": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 34, "section": "4.1.1 Inclusion Criteria", "exactText": "", "bboxes": [[71.99999999999994, 612.6239829101564, 521.16, 602.3349752178488], [71.99999999999994, 612.6239829101564, 521.16, 602.3349752178488], [72.00000000000006, 489.6239829101564, 551.7600000000001, 403.37497521784866]], "relevance": "high"}, {"name": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 9, "section": "Inclusion Criteria", "exactText": "", "bboxes": [[72.00000000000001, 124.94398291015625, 521.0400000000001, 114.65497521784857], [72.00000000000001, 124.94398291015625, 521.0400000000001, 114.65497521784857]], "relevance": "high"}, {"name": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 10, "section": "Inclusion Criteria", "exactText": "", "bboxes": [[72.00000000000006, 606.6239829101562, 548.5200000000001, 520.3749752178485]], "relevance": "high"}], "timing": {"response_cache_hit": false, "semantic_cache_hit": false, "chunks_compressed": true, "condense_ms": 0.00200001522898674, "query_condensed": false, "embedding_ms": 741.8004591017962, "embedding_cache_hit": false, "retrieval": {"chunk_cache_hit": false, "confidence_filter_applied": true, "confidence_filter_threshold": 0.04, "confidence_filter_bm