INFO     rag_service.services.generation_service:generation_service.py:427 {"event": "rag_query_trace", "query": "Which visits require an ECG?", "retrieval_query": null, "system_prompt_version": "440b2406", "retrieved_chunks": [{"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 55, "section": "7.1.5 Electrocardiogram", "score": null, "scores": [0.98020524, 0.0054692747], "had_context": true}, {"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 49, "section": "6.2.2 Screening Period (Days -28 to -1 prior to Visit 2)", "score": 0.08122776, "scores": null, "had_context": true}, {"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 50, "section": "6.2.4 12-week Treatment Period (Visits 3 to 8)", "score": 0.023286305, "scores": null, "had_context": true}, {"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 52, "section": "6.4 Unscheduled Visits", "score": 0.022457052, "scores": null, "had_context": true}, {"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 45, "section": "Table 1 Time and Events Schedule", "score": 0.0043994132, "scores": null, "had_context": true}], "context_char_count": 6168, "response": "Source: Protocol Ulcerative Colitis.pdf\n\nECG assessments are required at the following visits:\n\n1. A routine 12-lead ECG will be performed at **Visits 1, 1.1, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, and 9**.\n[Section 7.1.5 Electrocardiogram \u00b7 p.55]\n\n2. During the **Screening Period**, a 12-lead ECG is specifically listed as a procedure at **Visit 1.1** (second screening visit, Days -28 to -1 prior to Visit 2).\n[Section 6.2.2 Screening Period (Days -28 to -1 prior to Visit 2) \u00b7 p.49]\n\n3. During the **12-week Treatment Period (Visits 3 to 8)**, a 12-lead ECG is required at **all visits** (Visits 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, and 8).\n[Section 6.2.4 12-week Treatment Period (Visits 3 to 8) \u00b7 p.50]\n\n4. Additionally, ECGs may be performed at **unscheduled visits** if deemed necessary by the Investigator (e.g., for safety reasons or if missed at a previous visit).\n[Section 6.4 Unscheduled Visits \u00b7 p.52]", "sources": [{"name": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 55, "section": "7.1.5 Electrocardiogram", "exactText": "", "bboxes": [[71.99999999999972, 136.82398291015602, 539.2799999999997, 111.29497521784833], [71.99999999999989, 561.1439829101562, 542.7599999999999, 520.4949752178485]], "relevance": "high"}, {"name": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 49, "section": "6.2.2 Screening Period (Days -28 to -1 prior to Visit 2)", "exactText": "", "bboxes": [[89.87999999999995, 365.6399829101567, 354.23999999999995, 354.894975217849]], "relevance": "high"}, {"name": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 50, "section": "6.2.4 12-week Treatment Period (Visits 3 to 8)", "exactText": "", "bboxes": [[89.88, 432.47998291015625, 291.24, 421.73497521784856]], "relevance": "high"}, {"name": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 52, "section": "6.4 Unscheduled Visits", "exactText": "", "bboxes": [[72.00000000000006, 506.1839829101565, 548.76, 389.5749752178487]], "relevance": "high"}, {"name": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 45, "section": "Table 1 Time and Events Schedule", "exactText": "", "bboxes": [[75.06486511230469, 495.4773864746094, 810.2346801757812, 247.2222900390625]], "relevance": "high"}], "timing": {"response_cache_hit": false, "semantic_cache_hit": false, "chunks_compressed": true, "condense_ms": 0.0014170072972774506, "query_condensed": false, "embedding_ms": 651.4541660435498, "embedding_cache_hit": false, "retrieval": {"chunk_cache_hit": false, "confidence_filter_applied": true, "confidence_filter_threshold": 0.04, "confidence_filter_bm25_threshold": null, "confidence_filter_input_count": 45, "confidence_filter_kept_count": 45, "confidence_filter_dropped_count": 0, "confidence_filter_kept_scores": [0.5953, 0.5345, 0.5266, 0.4833, 0.4797, 0.4595, 0.4489, 0.4474, 0.4467, 0.4382, 0.4335, 0.431, 0.429, 0.4272, 0.4245, 0.4221, 0.4172, 0.4136, 0.4032, 0.4025, 0.397, 0.3937, 0.3923, 0.3889, 0.3846, 0.3843, 0.3842, 0.3838, 0.3828, 0.3799, 0.378,